		}
		{
			dependencies: ["545210E1EB9C1D44"]
			description: ["Barnard b is mostly iron, with nickel, cobalt and a rhenium-rich residue. The &6Barnard Core Rock&r is what the carbonyl route starts from, and the rhenium goes home for the Mk2 drive."]
			icon: "grindless:barnard_core_rock"
