		{
			dependencies: ["572E0C57B385B5AF"]
			description: ["The &6UEV Circuit Assembler&r is the first assembler that can put together the optical computers that UEV machines are built around. A UEV hull and UEV components, and the cleanroom you already run. The optical computer on the rows below, and the controller of every machine past the UEV hull. Boards and chips arrive from the cleanroom by ME; keep a small stock of what it returns."]
			icon: "gtceu:uev_circuit_assembler"
			id: "5807DC537AFBD8BF"
