			title: "Lithium Niobate on Insulator"
			x: 6.5d
			y: 10.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["572E0C57B385B5AF"]
			description: ["Light travels in silicon nitride with almost no loss. An annealed &6SiN Chip&r carries the waveguides cut into it. The photonic foundry, a damascene SiN wafer and the cleanroom. The waveguide circuit, which joins it to the LNOI wafer. The anneal is slow, so run two foundries; keep chips in a stocked chest by ME."]
			icon: "grindless:annealed_sin_chip"
			id: "3C3FC8DE94FAC5EE"
			rewards: [{ id: "5F86BE3492E5476D", type: "xp", xp: 100 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [{ id: "3BD13B6D0D20912D", item: "grindless:annealed_sin_chip", type: "item" }]
			title: "Silicon Nitride Chip"
			x: 6.5d
			y: 12.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["15B48323A772E536", "3C3FC8DE94FAC5EE"]
			description: ["An SiN chip bonded to an LNOI wafer is a &6Waveguide Circuit&r: light goes in, is steered and switched, and comes out. The photonic integration hall, one SiN chip, one LNOI wafer and a circuit 1 program. The quantum photonic chip, which puts sources and detectors on it. One chip and one wafer per circuit: stock both by ME and send circuits on."]
			icon: "grindless:waveguide_circuit"
			id: "1EB339EC7EEE0427"
			rewards: [{ id: "16AF97B8E6AAC7D6", type: "xp", xp: 120 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [{ id: "5B3AB2F3F89B7D6D", item: "grindless:waveguide_circuit", type: "item" }]
			title: "Waveguide Circuit"
			x: 9.5d
			y: 11.25d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["572E0C57B385B5AF"]
			description: ["Indium arsenide islands a few nanometres wide emit one photon at a time. The &6InAs Quantum Dot Wafer&r is where the chip's source comes from. UHV's MBE reactor, indium and arsenic, which is contained. The quantum dot source, mounted and ready for the chip. Contain the arsenic loop; keep wafers by ME and cut one source per chip."]
			icon: "grindless:inas_qd_wafer"
			id: "750B64193AFA4A16"
			rewards: [{ id: "3900C32593C9D1D1", type: "xp", xp: 120 }]
