			dependencies: ["1BE00654ED22DDB6"]
			description: ["The &6Calutron&r bends a beam of ions in a magnet, and each isotope lands in its own cup. A UHV hull, the stable casing and the ion source parts, with power for the magnet. Calcium-48 and plutonium-244, the bullet and the target of every superheavy run. Feed the ore dust by ME and send each isotope to its own chest; the rest returns for another pass."]
